| description = In the Neriak Commons can be found the guildhall of The Spurned.

Here Dark Elf casters practice the lesser magical arts (necromancy is, of course, considered the greatest art by dark elves).  Being spurned by Dark Elf society, they actively oppose [[The Dead]] whose Necromancers and Shadow Knights enjoy the favor of [[Queen Cristanos Thex]]. They seem to be allied with [[King Naythox Thex]] and the [[Priests of Innoruuk]].

[[Camia V`Retta]] trains the [[Enchanter]]s, [[Jayna D`Bious]] the [[Magician]]s and [[Gath N`Mare]] the [[Wizard]]s.

Note that several Wizards in Neriak Commons are on [[The Dead]] faction instead of this one.

